==Event Information==
"Nyanko Daisensou" will be exhibited at "BitSummit X-Roads" to be held on August 6th (Saturday) and August 7th (Sunday) at "Miyako Messe", Kyoto Municipal Industrial Exhibition Hall!<br>
To commemorate the event, a limited time sponsorship commemorative event will be held!<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''The event is scheduled to run from August 6th, 2022 (11:00) to August 7th, 2023 (23:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#FBBC04|'''●Commemorative Stage "Sponsor BitSummit Commemorative!" is held!'''}}<br>
During the event period, go to Legend Story (Event Stage) from the "Nyanko Daisensou" app title screen and tap the "Start Battle!!" button, the "Sponsorship BitSummit Memorial!" will appear!

Clear the stages and get {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''Rare Tickets'''}}!

<small><small>※If you cannot see the stage "Sponsorship BitSummit Memorial!", you need to update your app to the latest version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FBBC04|'''●Commemorative login bonus appears!'''}}<br>
Log in during the following period and receive {{Color|#4C9AFF|'''10 Cat Food'''}} one time only!<br>
Don't forget to log in!<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''The event is scheduled to run from August 6th, 2022 (0:00) to August 7th, 2022 (23:59)!'''}}

<small><small>※You must update your app to the latest version to receive the login bonus.</small></small>

In addition, the "BitSummit X-Roads" Real Nyanko Daisensou Photo Spot will be launched at the Ponos booth on the day of the event!<br>
Check out the hashtag "[https://twitter.com/hashtag/リアルにゃんこ大戦争 #RealNyankoDaisensou]" on Twitter to see how the event went!

Learn more about "BitSummit X-Roads" Click here for more information<br>
https://bitsummit.org/ja/

